				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-403847#post-1818688</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-403847/recording-stuff-or-whatever#post-1818688</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 21 Jul 2013 15:30:44 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Anaxagoras</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1019930</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I actually dislike this. The humor is largely strained, and vaguely hypocritical, in that something deploring nonclinical tone is written in such an extremely nonclinical manner itself. Plus, the stuff it's trying to discourage is largely low-hanging fruit of SCP errors. Yes, there's lots of people who don't get it right, but this is a poor way to convey it to them.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
