						 <p>Did someone call for an alchemist? I think I saw one right here!</p> <p>No, seriously. Ouch. That one was a little personal. That was from the Holy Grail, right? The part about if you become obsessed with it, you have to go on a quest, and if you aren't sure about it talk to an alchemist?</p> <p>This was excellent though. Great call-out on the excessive vernacular used in some of the newer SCPs. I'd vote again if I could.</p> 
				 	]]>
